/wvusports.com/news/2026/9/27/tennis-mountaineers-wrap-up-penn-invitational</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/27/tennis-mountaineers-wrap-up-penn-invitational</guid><category>Tennis</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Laura Morillo returns a serve during a tennis match in the 2025-26 season" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/9/27/BBD09114__1_.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The West Virginia University tennis team wrapped up its second tournament of the fall season at the Penn Invitational on Saturday.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/27/BBD09114__1_.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/27/BBD09114__1_.jpg"><media:title>Laura Morillo returns a serve during a tennis match in the 2025-26 season</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/27/BBD09114__1_.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Sun, 27 Sep 2026 17:37:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>15</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59449</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Handle Business at Iowa State</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/27/womens-soccer-mountaineers-handle-business-at-iowa-state</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/27/womens-soccer-mountaineers-handle-business-at-iowa-state</guid><category>Women's Soccer</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Sophia Nickel runs down the field in a match at Iowa State on Sept. 27." src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/9/27/WSOC_vs_Iowa_St.jpg" /><br /><br />AMES, Iowa – The No. 10-ranked West Virginia University women's soccer team (6-1-2, 1-1-1 Big 12)