6_WSOC_Marshall_GB_096.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 13:13:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>13</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59443</s:story_id></item><item><title>West Virginia and Marshall to Meet for Mountain State Derby</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/26/mens-soccer-west-virginia-and-marshall-to-meet-for-mountain-state-derby</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/9/26/mens-soccer-west-virginia-and-marshall-to-meet-for-mountain-state-derby</guid><category>Men's Soccer</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Thomas Bowe in action for the West Virginia men's soccer team" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/9/25/MSOCvsDuquesne_Sep22_2026_AM_107_large.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The No. 21 West Virginia University men's soccer team hits the road for the 32nd edition of the Mountain State Derby when it takes on Marshall on Sunday evening. Kickoff from Hoops Family Field in Huntington is set for 7:15 p.m.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/25/MSOCvsDuquesne_Sep22_2026_AM_107_large.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/25/MSOCvsDuquesne_Sep22_2026_AM_107_large.jpg"><media:title>Thomas Bowe in action for the West Virginia men's soccer team</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/25/MSOCvsDuquesne_Sep22_2026_AM_107_large.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 11:59:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>6</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59440</s:story_id></item></channel></rss>